2026-05-18 12:35:44,093 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-40c45ff7-03e7-4940-91d6-9a436fb3fd3e', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Extract all job/position listings from this career page HTML.\nReturn a JSON array where each element has:\n- "title": job title string\n- "url": full URL to the job posting (resolve relative URLs against https://cset.georgetown.edu/careers/)\n- "location": location if mentioned, else null\n- "role_type": "Full-time", "Part-time", "Fellowship", "Internship", or null\n\nOnly include actual job openings, internships, and fellowships.\nIgnore navigation links, news articles, blog posts, event listings, etc.\nIf there are no job listings on the page, return an empty array: []\nReturn ONLY valid JSON, no other text.\n\n---\n\n<main class="main" id="main" role="main" tabindex="-1">\n<div class="l-preface">\n<div class="l-constrain">\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Provided by templates/page.twig -->\n<div class="page-title">\n<div class="l-constrain">\n<div class="page-title__inner">\n<h1 class="page-title__title">Careers</h1>\n              CSET researchers and staff members are challenged with meaningful work, pursue ongoing professional development and learning, and contribute to a collegial and engaging environment where they can thrive. We are committed to fostering a culture of inclusion and encourage individuals with diverse backgrounds and experiences to apply. We especially encourage applications from women, people of color, and individuals with disabilities who are excited about contributing to our mission.\n                      </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="l-constrain--small post-content">\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img alt="" class="wp-image-24413" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="394" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-700x394.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-700x394.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-250x141.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-768x432.png 768w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-1536x864.png 1536w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-120x68.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-150x84.png 150w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-350x197.png 350w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100.png 1600w" width="700"/></figure>\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/research-or-senior-fellow-frontier-ai/">Frontier AI Research Lead</a> </strong></h4>\n<p>CSET is currently accepting applications to lead a new team focused on Frontier AI issues.  This role will oversee the execution of research and the production of reports, including shaping priorities and outlining the overall research strategy for the team. More information on the role can be found <a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/research-or-senior-fellow-frontier-ai/">here.</a></p>\n<p><em>Applications for Frontier AI Research Lead will be reviewed on a rolling basis.</em></p>\n<hr/>\n<hr/>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img alt="" class="wp-image-24417" decoding="async" height="394" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-102-700x394.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-102-700x394.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-102-250x141.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-102-768x432.png 768w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-102-1536x864.png 1536w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-102-120x68.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-102-150x84.png 150w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-102-350x197.png 350w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-102.png 1600w" width="700"/></figure>\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/ux-engineer/">UX Engineer</a> </strong></h4>\n<p>CSET is currently seeking a UX Engineer to oversee UX improvements end-to-end, including conducting user research, building and testing front-end code, and delivering polished, accessible interfaces across CSET’s digital ecosystem. More information on the role can be found <a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/ux-engineer/">here.</a></p>\n<p><em>Application deadline:</em> <em><strong>May 18th, 2026</strong>.</em></p>\n<hr/>\n<hr/>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img alt="" class="wp-image-24676" decoding="async" height="394" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-104.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-104.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-104-250x141.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-104-120x68.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-104-150x84.png 150w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-104-350x197.png 350w" width="700"/></figure>\n<p><strong><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/data-scientist-2/">Data Scientist </a></strong></p>\n<p>CSET is seeking a Data Scientist for\xa0<a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/article/georgetowns-center-for-security-and-emerging-technology-awarded-2m-google-org-funding/">a new project</a>\xa0focused on improving bibliometric data, developing methods and metrics to identify emerging areas in science and technology, and providing open data and infrastructure to support research and decision making, including improving CSET’s\xa0<a href="https://sciencemap.eto.tech/">Map of Science</a>\xa0and related tools.\xa0More information on the role can be found <a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/data-scientist-2/">here. </a><br/></p>\n<p><em>Application deadline:</em> <em><strong>June 1st, 2026</strong>.</em></p>\n<hr/>\n<hr/>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/georgetown-student-opportunities/" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="" class="wp-image-15929" decoding="async" height="900" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities.png 1600w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-250x141.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-700x394.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-768x432.png 768w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-1536x864.png 1536w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-120x68.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-150x84.png 150w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-350x197.png 350w" style="width:700px;height:auto" width="1600"/></a></figure>\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/georgetown-student-opportunities/"><span class="tadv-color" style="color:#003da6">Georgetown Student Opportunities</span></a><span class="tadv-color" style="color:#003da6"> </span></h4>\n<p>CSET is hiring undergraduate and master’s students for the following roles:</p>\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><strong>Space Debris Student Research Assistant</strong> (JR25465) to support a research project focused on space debris responsibility and classification. Read the position description and apply <a href="https://www.myworkday.com/georgetown/d/inst/15$158872/9925$44141.htmld">here</a>.\xa0</li>\n<li><strong>ETO Student Research Assistant </strong>(JR25471) to support our Emerging Technology Observatory (ETO) platform. This role is open to undergraduates and Masters students. Read the position description and apply <a href="https://www.myworkday.com/georgetown/d/inst/15$158872/9925$44133.htmld">here</a>.\xa0</li>\n<li><strong>Office Assistant</strong> (JR25473) to provide administrative support to our team. Read the position description and apply <a href="https://www.myworkday.com/georgetown/d/inst/15$158872/9925$44142.htmld">here</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All applications for student employment must be submitted via GMS. More information can be found on our\xa0Student Opportunities <a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/georgetown-student-opportunities/">page</a>.</p>\n<hr/>\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Culture Statement</h3>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized" id="Culture-Statement"><a href="#Culture-Statement"><img alt="" class="wp-image-17006" decoding="async" height="3300" sizes="(max-width: 2550px) 100vw, 2550px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET.png 2550w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-250x324.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-700x906.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-768x994.png 768w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-1187x1536.png 1187w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-1583x2048.png 1583w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-120x155.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-116x150.png 116w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-270x350.png 270w" style="width:1078px;height:auto" width="2550"/></a></figure>\n<hr/>\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><span class="underline" style="text-decoration: underline">Resources</span> </h3>\n<h5 class="wp-block-heading">FAQ’s:</h5>\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nD6Y9mytlMJBvfIDUZI45NtwQ3ASC14WzfJqZTEDcqg/edit#heading=h.nisttvk8h58n">Research Analyst/Data Research Analyst FAQ</a></li>\n<li><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P6mGbiNs7OihHHS1Y7i2_sHgPmZch_L_wdMy0o6rqeo/edit#heading=h.nisttvk8h58n">Research Fellow FAQ</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class="wp-block-heading">Previous hiring info session recordings:</h5>\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/event/cset-hiring-info-session/">Research Analyst/Data Research Analyst Hiring Info Session</a> (2/10/22)</li>\n<li><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/event/cset-research-fellow-hiring-info-session/">Research Fellow Hiring Info Session</a> (8/4/22)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><span class="underline" style="text-decoration: underline">Contact Us</span> </h3>\n<p>For all inquiries related to current job openings, please contact us at <a href="mailto:csetcareers@georgetown.edu">csetcareers@georgetown.edu</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n</div>\n<div class="l-postscript">\n<div class="l-constrain">\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
