, as this allows both sides to ensure a great fit. While we are open to hiring directly for permanent positions, this path has significantly higher requirements.</p><p>Most successful candidates have a strong theoretical background (in math, physics or computer science, for example). Empirical machine learning background is a plus, but is not required for a strong application.</p><p>For questions about roles at ARC, email us at hiring@[domain].org. </p>\n</section>\n</article>\n</main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
