s="brand-logotype is-positive" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7/66886e33b08f49fb5ee91687_584d03b1fc431c846cd06f6237351573_Gray%20Swan%3DDark%20Horizontal.svg"/></div></a></div></div></div><div class="navigation-mob w-nav" data-animation="over-right" data-collapse="medium" data-doc-height="1" data-duration="400" data-easing="ease-out" data-easing2="ease-out" role="banner"><div class="navigation-container-mob"><a class="navigation-logo-container w-nav-brand" href="/"><div class="logo-wrapper"><img alt="" class="brand-logotype" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7/66886e33ca0b8f284d3b3b40_ca18847e7b3f6e2e7038dac7bd3846ce_Gray%20Swan%3DWhite%20Horizontal.svg"/><img alt="" class="brand-logotype is-positive" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7/66886e33b08f49fb5ee91687_584d03b1fc431c846cd06f6237351573_Gray%20Swan%3DDark%20Horizontal.svg"/></div></a><div class="navigation-menu-button w-nav-button"><div class="w-embed"></div></div></div></div></div><section class="header interior"><div class="padding-global z-2"><div class="container-large"><div class="hero-text-wrapper"><div class="breadcrumb neg-margin"><a class="text-link-background w-inline-block" href="/careers-copy"><div class="all-caps t-c-white">Careers</div></a></div><div class="padding-sm"></div><h1 class="hero-text" data-w-id="9f32cf13-2f33-7f82-70a9-b7596f3203a5">Making AI Safe to Ship</h1><div><div class="padding-sm"></div><p class="t-c-white text-size-md" data-w-id="15650e45-56be-0233-742c-2c884daa3f30">Real stakes. Real-world impact.</p><div class="padding-sm"></div></div><div class="button-wrapper portrait-full"><a class="button is-yellow w-inline-block" href="#open-positions"><div>View open positions</div></a><a class="text-link-background portrait-half hide w-inline-block" href="#"><div class="t-c-white">Model Metrics</div></a><a class="text-link-background portrait-half hide w-inline-block" href="#"><div class="t-c-white">Pricing</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="background-fill overlay"></div><div class="hero-on-load"><div class="hero-vector w-embed">\n</div></div></section><section class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="w-layout-grid _2x-grid _30-70"><div id="w-node-_298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5a3-d72d58a1"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="sticky"><h2 class="heading-medium">The Hardest Problems Emerge at the Edge of AI</h2><div class="padding-xs"></div><p>The most interesting, and messiest, problems show up at the edges.</p><div class="padding-xs"></div><div class="padding-md hide-tablet"></div></div></div><div class="column gap-0"><div class="left-border-card-wrapper" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5ab"><div class="padding-lg hide-tablet"></div><div class="border-left" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5ad"></div><p>Gray Swan has made a habit of being first in line. We’re often the first to spot new failure modes, and, by extension, the first to defend against them. Being research-first isn’t a tagline. It’s how we build our products, our playbooks, and our culture of thinking three steps ahead.</p><div class="padding-xs"></div><p>Whether it’s stress-testing the latest agentic AI in a lab or helping enterprises deploy at full speed, our goal is the same: uncover the hard problems before anyone else does, then turn that insight into real-world solutions that let innovation happen, safely and without slowing down.</p></div><div class="left-border-card-wrapper" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5c8"><div class="border-left" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5ca"></div></div><div class="left-border-card-wrapper hide-tablet" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5e5"><div class="padding-md"></div><div class="border-left" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5e7"></div></div><div class="left-border-card-wrapper" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a605"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="border-left" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a607"></div></div></div></div><div class="hr-200 is-heavy"></div></div></section><section><div class="w-embed"></div><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="column align-center text-align-center"><h2 class="heading-medium">Trusted at the Frontier</h2><p>Our research has directly informed the safety evaluations of some of the most advanced AI models in the world.</p></div><div class="padding-sm"></div><div class="model-list-wrapper"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="collection-list featured w-dyn-items" featured="" role="list"><div class="w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="card horizontall---2" data-featured="true"><div class="featured-model-wrapper v2"><h3 class="tag">New Release</h3><div class="div-block-95"><img alt="" class="model-logo" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2be/69e7d85f21121d47a3a2e058_Anthropic_logo.svg" width="124"/></div><div class="model-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-xs">Mythos Preview</h3></div></div><a class="button is-white w-inline-block" href="https://cdn.sanity.io/files/4zrzovbb/website/7624816413e9b4d2e3ba620c5a5e091b98b190a5.pdf" target="_blank"><div>View Model Card</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="collection-list _4-up-grid w-dyn-items" featured="" role="list"><div class="w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="card smaller" data-featured="false"><div class="model-logo-wrapper"><img alt="" class="model-logo" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2be/69e7d85f21121d47a3a2e058_Anthropic_logo.svg" width="124"/></div><h3 class="heading-xs align-center">Claude Opus 4.7</h3><a class="button is-small is-white w-inline-block" href="https://cdn.sanity.io/files/4zrzovbb/website/037f06850df7fbe871e206dad004c3db5fd50340.pdf" target="_blank"><div>View