5" data-settings=\'{"jet_parallax_layout_list":[]}\'>\n<div class="e-con-inner">\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7ef0761 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-e-type="widget" data-element_type="widget" data-id="7ef0761" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<p>Stimson is an equal-opportunity employer and\xa0is committed to a workplace informed by\xa0<a class="c-link" data-sk="tooltip_parent" data-stringify-link="https://stimson.org/about/transparency/our-core-values/" href="https://stimson.org/about/transparency/our-core-values/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">our core values</a>.\xa0In addition to a warm, collegial work environment, we offer a competitive benefits package, which includes health and dental plans, three weeks of annual leave, 12 paid holidays each calendar year, commuter and wellness benefits, and much more.</p> </div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b241f14 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-e-type="widget" data-element_type="widget" data-id="b241f14" data-widget_type="button.default" id="employment-button">\n<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md" href="https://stimson.applicantpro.com/jobs/" target="_blank">\n<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">\n<span class="elementor-button-icon">\n </span>\n<span class="elementor-button-text">Browse Open Postings</span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-032d7e5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-e-type="widget" data-element_type="widget" data-id="032d7e5" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">\n<p>Postings are updated as positions become available. Because of recruiting volume, we kindly ask that you do not contact the office to follow up on your application. Should your application move forward in the hiring process, we will contact you directly.</p> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n</div>\n<